WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:40.200
Can an imagined paper help find a real one?

00:00:40.200 --> 00:01:07.662
Query2doc adds generated language to the query

00:01:07.662 --> 00:01:39.986
HyDE searches from the generated document’s vector

00:01:39.986 --> 00:02:16.178
Real retrieval does not validate invented details

00:02:16.178 --> 00:02:53.689
AI-assisted input does not name one architecture

00:02:53.689 --> 00:03:34.746
Supported natural-language limits are a defined subset

00:03:34.746 --> 00:04:10.194
An inferred filter and a selected filter need separate checks

00:04:10.194 --> 00:04:48.400
Preserve the strategy that actually reached retrieval
